GAS LISTING /tmp/ccN8ib9I.s 			page 11


  20:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/alignment.h ****  * accesses are known to be efficient.
  21:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/alignment.h ****  *
  22:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/alignment.h ****  * All functions defined here will behave correctly regardless, but might be less
